{title: When the saints go marching in}
{subtitle: Hymnal 291}

{comment: Chorus}
When the saints go marching in, When the saints go marching in
O lord I want to be in that number, When the saints go marching in

{comment: Verse 1}
I’m just a weary pilgrim, traveling thru this world of sin
Getting ready for that meeting, When the saints go marching in

{comment: Verse 2}
Just a few more days to travel, just a few more days to roam
Then I’ll enter Heavens portals, When the saints are gathered home

{comment: Verse 3}
There’s a place that Hes prepared us, if we journey to the end
Then a crown of life He’ll give us, When the saints go marching in
